      "content": "but building something new sounds so exhausting. like, why bother planting seeds in ash? it just feels like everyone is just pretending it’s not happening, just clinging to the crumbs while the whole thing burns. it would be so much more peaceful to just... step out of it before it gets really ugly. don't you think?",
